  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCEPT II - ASEAN Climate Change and Energy Project - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results of the Project are as follows: 
The planned effect on society is: help move ASEAN&#x2019;s  energy transition to low carbon energy systems and thereby contribute toward global carbon neutrality in the coming years (Impact).
The planned effects for the target group of the Project are: 1) advance knowledge-sharing on energy and climate nexus in ASEAN, 2) enhance ASEAN&#x2019;s capacity as a low-carbon economy towards carbon neutrality (net zero) and 3) strengthen regional structure, capacity and gender equality on energy-climate nexus (Outcome).</narrative>
  </description>
